Package: txseq
Type: Package
Title: Helper Functions for RNA-seq Data Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Stephen", "Sansom", email = "snsansom@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides helper functions for RNA-seq data analysis, including
    quality control, normalisation, clustering, principal component analysis,
    differential expression plotting and database access, for use with the
    txseq Snakemake pipelines.
